export anchor EnterpriseShellStyle:
    number: 9
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Enterprise shell
    idea: A formal corporate suite, with a deep-blue shell bar, a collapsible tree nav, breadcrumbs and flat square tiles on light grey that frame the work like an official system of record.
    base: light
    palette:
        shell: #0f2a52, the shell bar and the top rule of the style sheet
        shellHover: #1d3f72, shell dividers and hover in the shell
        canvas: #edf0f4, the page behind the tiles
        tile: #ffffff, tiles, the tree nav and fields
        text: #1b2430, body text and headings
        muted: #556170, labels, meta text and chart axes
        line: #cdd3db, tile borders, with #e4e8ed between rows
        primary: #0b57b0, buttons, links, progress bars, this week's bars and the focus outline
        primaryDark: #083f80, primary hover and the current nav text
        selection: #e3edf9, the current nav item, pressed toggles and initials tiles
        positive: #1f6e3a, the On track circle
        attention: #8a5200, the At risk diamond, with the alert strip on #fff6e5
        critical: #b3241b, the Behind square and the overdue figure
    type:
        Segoe UI first, then system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif. Sizes are 24px semibold for the page title,
        15px semibold for tile titles, 14px regular body at 1.43 line height,
        13px for table cells and meta, and 12px semibold for labels. Tree
        group headings are 12px semibold capitals with 0.06em spacing. KPI
        figures are 32px light weight with tabular figures.
    layout:
        A 48px deep-blue shell bar with an app launcher, the wordmark and a
        product label, a white search field, notifications and the user. A
        white tree nav 248px wide on the left holds three collapsible groups,
        Workspace, Organisation and Administration, with counts and a
        Collapse navigation button at the bottom. The main area has
        breadcrumbs, a toolbar with the title Portfolio overview, the
        greeting line and the Customise, Export and New project buttons, then
        an amber alert strip for the overdue tasks. A row of four KPI tiles
        follows, two with micro charts. Below, the projects table tile takes
        two thirds and a column of the Throughput chart tile and the Recent
        activity tile takes one third. Below 820px the tree becomes a
        horizontal tab row under the shell, and below 560px the search drops
        to its own row and the tiles stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 8px gaps between tiles, 16px tile padding and a 24px page gutter.
    density: Compact. 44px table rows, 36px nav rows and a 48px shell bar.
    corners: 4px on tiles and 2px on buttons, fields, avatars and segmented controls.
    borders: 1px #cdd3db around every tile, 1px #e4e8ed between rows and a 3px primary bar on the left of the current nav item.
    shadows: None. Tiles are flat and separated by the grey canvas.
    icons:
        16px line icons with a 1.5 stroke, square caps and mitred joins.
        Status uses filled 14px shapes beside the word, a circle with a tick,
        a diamond with a bar and a square with a cross, and a legend under
        the table names each shape. People show as square initials tiles.
    focus: A 2px primary outline offset 1px, white inside the shell bar. A focused field gets a primary border plus the outline, and a focused row gets the selection fill with an inset outline.
    tone: Formal and neutral, such as Portfolio overview, Throughput, Attention required and Review overdue tasks.
